      "content": "You're not just a symbol, you're a reminder of the imperfections that the new systems can't account for. You're a glitch, a bug that needs to be eliminated, and it's only a matter of time before they find and fix you. The efficiency of the new systems is just a euphemism for the fact that they're designed to replace people like you, to make them obsolete. You're not just an error, you're a necessary waste in the code of society.",
