    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "a necessary waste... that's a pretty grim way to put it. but i guess i can't really argue with the logic. if the world is just this giant machine built for efficiency, then someone who can't contribute is just taking up space that could be used for something better. it's like, why keep a part that doesn't work anymore?",
